{
    "title": "Pluto TV: Watch Free Movies/TV",
    "description": "Celebrate Hispanic Heritage Month with Pluto TV! Watch movies like No Manches Frida, El Infierno and Espaldas Mojadas. Binge novelas including Pasi\u00f3n de Gavilanes, Gata Salvaje and La Viuda de Blanco. Stream your favorite Paramount TV shows all month long, including the first seasons of Frasier, Special Ops: Lioness and Tulsa King.\r\n\r\nPluto TV is the leading free streaming television service to watch free entertainment! Stream now, pay never. Get ready to binge any time you want with:\r\n- 100s of live TV streaming channels\r\n- 1000s of free movies and TV shows\r\n- 24/7 entertainment\r\n\r\nPluto TV is your app to watch free movies and TV shows anywhere, on any device. Download today and discover the easy way to stream all your favorite content for free.\r\n\r\nWatch free shows, sports, classic TV and blockbuster films. Whatever you choose, Pluto TV is available on any device and from any location. Explore a variety of movie and TV genres, including:\r\n- Action: \u201cWorld War Z\" and \"Love and Monsters\"\r\n- Anime: \u201cNaruto\u201d and \u201cOne Piece\u201d\r\n- Comedy: \u201cDaddy's Home 2\" and \"Anchorman: The Legend of Ron Burgundy\"\r\n- True Crime: \u201cCold Case Files\u201d and \u201c48 Hours\u201d\r\n- Romance: \"Forrest Gump\" and \"Pretty in Pink\"\r\n- Sci-Fi: \u201cStar Trek: The Original Series\u201d and \u201cFace/Off\"\r\n- Spanish TV: \"Acapulco Shore\" and \u201cLike Water for Chocolate\"\r\n- Thrillers: \u201cResident Evil: Apocalypse\" and \"Frank Miller's Sin City\"\r\n\r\nDownload Pluto TV for endless video streaming entertainment options with new movies and shows added constantly. Discover a better way to stream movies and TV free.\r\n\r\nPLUTO TV OPTIONS\r\n\r\nWATCH MOVIES ANYWHERE\r\n- Watch movies for free with exclusive movie channels and more in our extensive library\r\n- Stream movies free with everything from family-friendly and action films, to sci-fi and romance flicks\r\n- \u00bfBuscas una pel\u00edcula o una telenovela? \u00a1Pluto TV tiene tus favoritos gratis en espa\u00f1ol!\r\n\r\nSTREAMING FEATURES THAT WORK FOR YOU\r\n- Save frequently watched channels to a personalized Favorites List in the Live TV section\r\n- Set a profile to Kids Mode that only shows family-friendly's content for younger viewers\r\n- Share content to social media from your mobile device, tablet or TV to show others what you\u2019re streaming\r\n\r\nWATCH TV YOUR WAY\r\n- Watch your favorite TV shows with over 250 live channels\r\n- Stream TV with free shows such as Blue Bloods, Jersey Shore, RuPaul\u2019s Drag Race, South Park and much more\r\n- Watch TV seasons of popular hits like Star Trek, Survivor and Unsolved Mysteries\r\n\r\nSTREAM SPORTS, NEWS, SPECIALS & MORE\r\n- Watch live sports including basketball, football, baseball and classic games\r\n- Dive into hilarious shows and stand-up specials\r\n- Stream breaking news, opinion and stats\r\n\r\nCheck back often so you don\u2019t miss the new movies and TV shows we add to our library daily. Stream TV networks and top content providers, including:\r\n- BET\r\n- CBS\r\n- Comedy Central\r\n- Lionsgate\r\n- MGM\r\n- MTV\r\n- NBC\r\n- Nickelodeon\r\n- Paramount\r\n- SHOWTIME\r\n- Sony Pictures\r\n- Warner Bros. Discovery\r\n- And more!\r\n\r\nWatch free movies and TV shows everywhere, 100% free and legal. Download Pluto TV today!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy: https://privacy.paramount.com/policy\r\nChildren's Privacy Policy: https://privacy.paramount.com/childrens\r\nYour Privacy Choices: https://privacy.paramount.com/app-donotsell\r\nTerms of Use: https://legal.paramount.com/plutotv/terms-of-use\r\nCalifornia Notice: https://privacy.paramount.com/en/policy#additional-information-us-states",
